@startuml
participant Reader
participant Writer
participant Mutex
participant readSem
participant writeSem
Writer -> Mutex : Lock (waitW++)
Writer -> writeSem : Wait (wait for active readers)
Reader -> Mutex : Lock (waitW>0)
Reader -> readSem : Wait (new readers blocked)
Reader -> Mutex : EndRead, activeR==0
Reader -> writeSem : Release (wake waiting writer)
Writer -> Mutex : EndWrite
Writer -> readSem : Release(k) if no waiting writers
@enduml
